    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Newcombe Estates are delighted to present 16 Swift Hall, an impressive three bedroom, third floor apartment situated within the highly sought-after Collegewood development. This bright and spacious residence enjoys an enviable position with two private balconies, including a sun-filled south-facing balcony that floods the living accommodation with natural light throughout the day. \r\nThe apartment is presented in excellent condition and offers generously proportioned accommodation, including a spacious L-shaped living and dining room with direct access to the south-facing balcony, creating the perfect space for relaxing or entertaining. There are three well-appointed bedrooms, including two large double bedrooms, each with the benefit of its own en-suite bathroom, together with a comfortable third bedroom. \r\n Residents can enjoy beautifully maintained landscaped communal gardens and the convenience of pedestrian access directly to Castleknock Village, with its excellent selection of cafes, restaurants, shops and everyday amenities. \r\nIdeally located close to Castleknock Train Station, numerous bus routes, the Phoenix Park, Blanchardstown Centre, excellent schools, sorting facilities and the N3/M50 road network, this superb apartment offers and outstanding opportunity for owner-occupiers and investors alike. \r\nA superb light-filled home in one of Castleknock’s most desirable residential developments, combining generous accommodation with an unbeatable location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:\t    \r\n\r\nLounge:  L shaped with feature marble fireplace with marble inset and gas fire, solid walnut wood floor, dual aspect windows with views, door to balcony area with south facing aspect \r\n5.2x4.9m \t\t\r\n\t\r\nKitchen: fitted kitchen with wall and floor mounted units, tiled splash-back, porcelain tiled floor, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher, \r\noven and hob\r\n2.4x2.9m\t\t\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: L shaped with floor to ceiling built in wardrobes and door to private balcony overlooking communal green \r\n4.6x4.3m\t\r\n\r\nEnsuite: with shower, W.C and W.H.B, partially tiled walls and tiled floor \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: with floor to ceiling built in wardrobes \r\n4.9x3.0m\r\n\r\nEnsuite:  with shower, W.C and W.H.B, partially tiled walls and tiled floor \r\n\t\r\nBedroom 3: with built in wardrobes  \r\n2.8x2.4m\r\n\r\nBathroom: with bath, W.C and W.H.B, partially tiled walls and tiled floor"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Outside\r\nLarge private balcony with south facing aspect\r\nSecond balcony off master bedroom overlooking communal green area  \r\nLandscaped common areas incorporating mature green with trees and shrubs built over underground carpark\r\nOne car-parking space \r\n\r\n\r\nServices\r\nGFCH\r\nWired for alarm\r\nRational wooden double glazed windows\r\nIntercom system \r\nAnnual service charge €3,339\r\n\r\nLocal Area Information\r\nPublic transport routes that service Collegewood, Castleknock:\r\nBus: 37/38\r\nRail: Castleknock Rail Station\r\nNearby Areas: Castleknock Village, Phoenix Park and Blanchardstown Centre"
      },
      {
